    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d36-a1">

                <pb facs="0137" n="41" sameAs="frus:frus1898/pg41"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No. 60.]</seg></opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Tower to Mr.
                            Gutman.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Vienna</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1898-03-04"><hi rendition="#italic">March 4,
                        1898</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: A report has reached this legation, through
                    the Department of State at Washington, that you have been arrested while making
                    a visit to your friends in Hungary and are now obliged to perform military
                    service, from which, as an American citizen, you should be exempt.</p>
                <p>I wish you would inform me at once if this report is true; and if so, give me all
                    the facts of your case, in order that I may take proper steps to secure for you
                    the rights to which you are entitled.</p>
                <p>Very truly, yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <list>
                            <item>
                                <hi rendition="#small-caps">Charlemagne Tower.</hi>
                            </item>
                            <item>Mr. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Ignatz Gutman</hi>,<lb/><hi
                                    rendition="#italic">Twenty fifth Regiment of Hungarian
                                    Army,<lb/>Losoncz, Neograd, Hungary.</hi></item>
                        </list>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
